{
  "id": "NruxftSqoGmiAZg2",
  "name": "C4-10 Factuur-events ontvangen (MoneyBird-webhook)",
  "active": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "8dfdd184-9064-4632-9463-ce6fd87ff54f",
      "name": "Uitleg overzicht",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -620
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## C4-10 Factuur-events ontvangen\nHet adres dat in MoneyBird als webhook is geregistreerd. Doet bewust **weinig**: controleren, vastleggen, bevestigen en doorgeven. Alle regels zitten in **C4-11**.\n\nMoneyBird-events (registratie met `enabled_events`): de groep `sales_invoice_state_changed` (o.a. *_to_late*, *_to_paid*, *_to_uncollectible*, *_to_open*), `payment_registered` / `payment_destroyed` (deelbetaling, storno) en `subscription_cancelled`.\n\n- **Afzender controleren**: `webhook_token` (productie: ook de `Moneybird-Signature`-header).\n- **Idempotent**: MoneyBird stuurt bij elke push een `Idempotency-Key` en probeert tot 10× opnieuw. Al verwerkt → 200 \"duplicate\", niets dubbel.\n- **Eerst vastleggen, dan 200**: zo is een event nooit kwijt (C4-12 kijkt naar events die op *received* blijven hangen).",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 980,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0131ef36-1f26-45b6-a484-f858cd374e62",
      "name": "Uitleg 1 ontvangen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Controleren, vastleggen, bevestigen",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 1780,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5d7f472f-dc3b-47e1-aa8f-fd35334575d7",
      "name": "Uitleg 2 doorgeven",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1720,
        -240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Klant bepalen → C4-11 → log bijwerken\nEen `payment_registered` bevat alleen het factuur-ID, dus dan eerst de factuur ophalen voor het contact. Niet-relevante events worden gelogd als *ignored*.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 1560,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "86ac1eae-aa15-48df-b0f2-6b48db1246e2",
      "webhookId": "1c3548cc-1398-4391-b5b6-3a34006d3873",
      "name": "Webhook moneybird-events",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "moneybird-events",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f2f0bb1b-4577-4e12-9998-4e6996a3e6ad",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// In productie: het webhook_token/secret dat MoneyBird teruggeeft bij POST /webhooks, als n8n-credential.\nreturn [{ json: {\n  webhook_token: 'demo-c4-webhook-token',\n  relevante_events: [\n    'sales_invoice_state_changed_to_late', 'sales_invoice_state_changed_to_reminded',\n    'sales_invoice_state_changed_to_paid', 'sales_invoice_state_changed_to_uncollectible',\n    'sales_invoice_state_changed_to_open', 'sales_invoice_state_changed_to_pending_payment',\n    'sales_invoice_destroyed', 'payment_registered', 'payment_destroyed', 'subscription_cancelled'\n  ],\n  moneybird_base_url: 'http://127.0.0.1:5678/webhook/c4-moneybird/api/v2/adm-demo'\n}}];"
      },
      "notes": "Token van de webhook-registratie en welke MoneyBird-events ertoe doen. In productie: token/secret uit een n8n-credential."
    },
    {
      "id": "620e0635-6e9f-4f2c-9146-6ac7366bcce2",
      "name": "Event lezen & controleren",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('Config').first().json;\nconst req = $('Webhook moneybird-events').first().json;\nconst b = (req.body && typeof req.body === 'object' && !Array.isArray(req.body)) ? req.body : {};\nconst h = req.headers || {};\nconst entity = (b.entity && typeof b.entity === 'object') ? b.entity : {};\nconst action = String(b.action || '');\nconst entity_type = String(b.entity_type || '');\nconst entity_id = String(b.entity_id || entity.id || '');\n// MoneyBird stuurt per push een unieke Idempotency-Key; zonder header bouwen we er zelf een.\nconst idempotency_key = String(h['idempotency-key'] || '') || ['geen-key', b.webhook_id, entity_id, action, entity.updated_at || ''].join(':');\nconst mb_contact_id = String(entity.contact_id || (entity.contact || {}).id || '');\nreturn [{ json: {\n  token_ok: String(b.webhook_token || '') === cfg.webhook_token,\n  idempotency_key,\n  action,\n  entity_type,\n  entity_id,\n  mb_contact_id,\n  factuur_id_voor_lookup: (!mb_contact_id && entity.invoice_id) ? String(entity.invoice_id) : '',\n  relevant: cfg.relevante_events.includes(action),\n  raw: JSON.stringify(b).slice(0, 4000)\n}}];"
      },
      "notes": "Leest de MoneyBird-payload. De state in de payload wordt bewust NIET gebruikt: C4-11 haalt altijd de actuele stand op."
    },
